The Lodestone Guardians are semi-sentient constructs capable of shifting between dormant and active states. When inactive, they are indistinguishable from ordinary chunks of rock. {{source|The Dead Magic Island}} 
* '''Standard Variant''': The primary guardians are stocky human-sized, dark brown entities that patrol the outer maze corridors. {{source|The Dead Magic Island}}
* '''Leader Variant''': A singular, much taller variant featuring a distinct reddish-tinted stone composition. This elite unit acts with increased aggression and commands the secondary wave of defenses inside the inner golden chamber.{{source|The Dead Magic Island}}
